bottom line， kid

699
00:43:39,758 --> 00:43:42,961
Don't tell me
what you could've done

700
00:43:43,001 --> 00:43:44,883
Or what you
should've done

701
00:43:44,923 --> 00:43:46,444
Tell me what
you already did

702
00:43:46,484 --> 00:43:48,646
Tell me what yo

703
00:43:48,646 --> 00:43:50,888
u already did

704
00:43:50,928 --> 00:43:53,089
Tell me what
you already did

705
00:44:00,622 --> 00:44:03,903
